1
00:00:00,172 --> 00:00:02,142
(Sheldon:)No. No, this is a slippery slope, Leonard.

2
00:00:02,341 --> 00:00:04,971
See, it starts with a parking space.
Where does it end?

3
00:00:05,177 --> 00:00:08,667
(Sheldon:)It's like my dad always said,
"First they say you can't drink and drive.

4
00:00:08,914 --> 00:00:11,404
Next you can't let your 10-year-old
take the wheel...

5
00:00:11,617 --> 00:00:14,247
(Sheldon:)...while you sleep one off
in the backseat."

6
00:00:15,454 --> 00:00:18,854
(Leonard:)All that story does
is make me feel bad for your mother.

7
00:00:21,994 --> 00:00:24,964
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you're my best friend.
Why don't you ever take my side?

8
00:00:26,431 --> 00:00:29,661
(Leonard:)Because I can never understand
your side!

9
00:00:32,638 --> 00:00:33,968
(Howard:)Give it back.

10
00:00:34,172 --> 00:00:36,762
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry,
but could you be more specific?

11
00:00:36,975 --> 00:00:40,135
(Howard:)My Iron Man helmet.
Koothrappali saw you take it. Give it back.

12
00:00:40,345 --> 00:00:42,215
(Sheldon:)Oh, that.

13
00:00:42,447 --> 00:00:47,007
(Sheldon:)Well, see, I wanted it
and you weren't using it.

14
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:51,290
(Sheldon:)Apparently,
those are the rules we live by now.

15
00:00:52,691 --> 00:00:56,521
Payback, it truly is the B-word, isn't it?

16
00:00:57,996 --> 00:01:01,456
Sheldon, that is a $500
limited-edition collectible...

